{
    "talkId": "6985802",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 41,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Lauma": 23,
        "Player": 18
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698580201",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698580202",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "(Huh? Surely not again...)"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580203",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "(But this time, Lauma's the only one here... And it looks like she's actually sleeping.)"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580204",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "(Wh—What should I do? How about...)"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580205",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "Ah!"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580206",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "H—Hello..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698580207",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "#Ah, it's you, {NICKNAME}. I trust you are well?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580208",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "Were you having a nightmare?"
        },
        {
            "id": "698580209",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698580210",
            "speaker": "Player",
            "text": "You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to..."
        },
        {
            "id": "698580211",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "No, no, that's not it at all."
        },
        {
            "id": "698580212",
            "speaker": "Lauma",
            "text": "It's just... my antlers are quite heavy — I almost toppled over. It gave me quite a shock.",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698580213",
                    "text": "I see...",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698580215",
                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                            "text": "Haha, indeed it does."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698580216",
                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                            "text": "As you've seen, my antlers are bigger than everyone else's. It can get quite exhausting whenever I have to walk long distances."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698580217",
                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                            "text": "Which is why I try to find the time to come here and rest whenever I can. I fear I must have nodded off this time, however.",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698580218",
                                    "text": "That sounds hard.",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580220",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580221",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "I'm afraid nothing much helps beyond finding somewhere to sit down every now and then and taking a rest."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580222",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "Miss Aino once offered to produce a mechanical device that would help support my neck and antlers..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580223",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "While I was grateful, it didn't seem to be entirely... How should I put it..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580224",
                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                            "text": "Proper?"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580225",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "Hehe, yes, that's a fine choice of word."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580226",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "Someone in my role needs to maintain a certain image."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698580227",
                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                            "text": "As Moonchanter of the Frostmoon Scions, it would be unseemly to appear in public with a machine around my neck.",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698580228",
                                                    "text": "\"Mechanical Lady...\"",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698580230",
                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                            "text": "Indeed...",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698580231",
                                                                    "text": "Having your very own Paimon would solve the problem.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698580233",
                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                            "text": "Hmm? That's actually..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698580234",
                                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                                            "text": "Sorry! I was only joking."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698580235",
                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                            "text": "Hehehe..."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698580236",
                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                            "text": "I must say, I found that quite the amusing mental image."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698580237",
                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                            "text": "Thank you, a good laugh was exactly what I needed to chase the tiredness away.",
                                                                            "choices": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698580238",
                                                                                    "text": "Don't mention it.",
                                                                                    "response": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698580240",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                            "text": "Don't be a stranger. Feel free to drop by whenever you're passing through."
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "698580241",
                                                                                            "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                            "text": "I'll make sure we have all the fresh fruit you can eat."
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "698580239",
                                                                                    "text": "I'm here all week!"
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698580232",
                                                                    "text": "She could help you hold your antlers up from behind..."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698580229",
                                                    "text": "\"...of the Forest\"..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698580219",
                                    "text": "Is there anything that can be done to lighten the load?"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "698580214",
                    "text": "I guess sleeping sitting up takes skill."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}